    "detailed_description": "Explore &quot;The Neighbor&quot;, a challenging escape room set in the mysterious house of an enigmatic neighbor. Your mission: unveil the secrets hidden behind its doors and rooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Investigate and Discover: Explore every corner of the house, collect crucial evidence and solve clever puzzles that will test your ingenuity and skills.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the Mystery: Every door hides a new challenge and every clue brings you closer to revealing the truth. The captivating atmosphere will <br>keep you immersed in the adventure from start to finish.<br></li><li>Challenge for the Brave: Only the most astute and courageous will be able to succeed in unraveling all the secrets of &quot;The Neighbor&quot;. Are you up for the challenge?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore &quot;The Neighbor&quot;, a challenging escape room set in the mysterious house of an enigmatic neighbor. Your mission: unveil the secrets hidden behind its doors and rooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Investigate and Discover: Explore every corner of the house, collect crucial evidence and solve clever puzzles that will test your ingenuity and skills.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the Mystery: Every door hides a new challenge and every clue brings you closer to revealing the truth. The captivating atmosphere will <br>keep you immersed in the adventure from start to finish.<br></li><li>Challenge for the Brave: Only the most astute and courageous will be able to succeed in unraveling all the secrets of &quot;The Neighbor&quot;. Are you up for the challenge?</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Do you dare to discover the secrets hidden behind the next door? &quot;The Neighbor&quot; will immerse you in a thrilling adventure filled with mystery and suspense. Set in a haunting house, your mission is to unravel its dark secrets before it's too late.",
